            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 89373,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Thanks @59192. Taking a look now. Initial thought: the checklist asks for 'Revenue Growth' but doesn't specify the period (YoY, QoQ, MoM). We need to standardize this for consistent reporting. Also, for T3, I need to know which of these metrics will feed into the dashboard. The current list is a bit too long for a single view.",
            "mentions": [
              59192
