            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. On the compliance side, we need to add a mandatory check for client data consent, referencing the guidelines we'll develop in T8 and A4. We can't proceed with any analysis until that's confirmed. Also, the risk indicators section seems a bit light; I'd suggest adding checks for debt-to-equity ratio and customer concentration.",
