            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M31",
            "speaker_id": 89373,
            "reply_to": "M30",
            "text": "My comments are in A2 now. This brings up an important point: what do we do if a client can't provide all the 'Primary' data? We need to define a minimum data quality threshold for the service.",
            "mentions": [
              8267,
              59192
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M32",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M31",
            "text": "Agreed. I propose that for the pilot, a client must provide at least 80% of the 'Primary' financial metrics and all required legal consents. If not, they are not eligible for the service. This will be our decision D4.",
            "mentions": [
              89373,
              59192
