        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Finalize pricing, packaging, and commercial positioning for launch.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've drafted the Pricing and Packaging Model (A3) as part of T4. It includes three tiers: 'Essential', 'Growth', and 'Strategic'. Please review the inclusions and proposed price points. I need your feedback, especially from @59192 on the margin assumptions.",
            "mentions": [
              59192,
              89373,
              21210,
              509812
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 89373,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "Thanks. Looking at A3, the jump from 'Growth' to 'Strategic' is significant. Does 'Strategic' involve more complex BI work or just more consultant time? We should be clear on the delivery effort for each tier.",
            "mentions": [
              8267
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 59192,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "I see the cost assumptions in A3. Is the 'consultant time' cost based on a blended rate? I'm not sure how to verify the margin calculation without the base cost data.",
            "mentions": [
              8267
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "I like the names. 'Essential' sounds good. Can we call the top tier 'Platinum' maybe? Sounds more premium.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Good question. 'Strategic' assumes a deeper dive, including some custom BI analysis beyond our standard dashboards. I'll add a column to A3 specifying the estimated hours for both consultant and BI work per tier to make it transparent.",
            "mentions": [
              89373
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Yes, it's a blended rate approved by finance. I can share the source data with you separately for validation. Let's connect offline on that.",
            "mentions": [
              59192
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
