            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 509812,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "I'd lean towards 'Strategic' over 'Platinum'. It speaks more to the value and the consultative nature of the service, which is a stronger PR angle than just a generic premium label.",
