            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "Reading through A5. The message 'Guaranteed business growth' is a very strong claim. From a legal and delivery standpoint, we cannot guarantee growth. We provide data-driven advice to help them make better decisions. We need to soften this to something like 'Unlock your growth potential'. This also needs to be reflected in the operational playbook A6.",
